Use CPU blits for overlapping, unscaled copies within one subresource.
Avoid undefined OpenGL copies and llvmpipe's overlapping-memcpy abort.

XXX for test only ?

Index: dlls/wined3d/surface.c
--- dlls/wined3d/surface.c.orig
